# Pairs with ReadRequiresActiveGrant. A grant between tenants is not the
# reader's own authorization; the policy decision must still allow it.
MODULE: ReadSkipsReaderAuthorization
TARGET: ReadRequiresActiveGrant
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the crossing read is admitted on the grant without the reader's own policy allow
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
        pol == Allowed(rdr, ReadOp, ReadScope)
--- REPLACE
        pol == TRUE
--- END